WEBVTT

00:20.000 --> 00:23.199
- Why did she help him?
- Who cares about that?

00:25.359 --> 00:27.719
So now the hunt begins.

01:56.280 --> 01:58.719
<i>We now have an update on
the explosion that occurred last night.</i>

01:58.799 --> 02:02.719
Officials have determined
it was caused by a...

02:13.599 --> 02:15.719
Heed me, brave falcons.

02:16.599 --> 02:20.159
<i>The traitorous crow has just flown
from the fatherly nest.</i>

02:20.879 --> 02:23.039
<i>The crow deceived
all those in the nest</i>

02:23.120 --> 02:25.400
<i>and now shelters the tiger,
our greatest enemy.</i>

02:26.240 --> 02:28.479
<i>Do not let either of them
leave this place.</i>

02:29.520 --> 02:33.039
<i>Find them at all costs
and tear their hearts out.</i>

02:49.159 --> 02:50.680
You should stay still.

02:51.879 --> 02:54.319
It will take time for you to fully heal,

02:54.840 --> 02:56.879
even with
these cutting edge nanomachines.

02:58.199 --> 03:01.120
Wondering why I saved you?

03:02.840 --> 03:04.719
Well, hello there, Mr. Ducky.

03:05.280 --> 03:08.960
Sorry for pulling the wool over your eyes.

03:09.360 --> 03:12.280
This is just one of my personas,
and it isn't even my real face.

03:13.360 --> 03:16.240
- You did that to get close to me?
- Yes, exactly.

03:17.759 --> 03:20.560
The chieftain of the organization
dispatched me on a mission.

03:20.639 --> 03:22.280
You died and were revived by a secret art
that we knew nothing about.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.840
I was sent to uncover the truth
behind your resurrection.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.080
We operated on the assumption

03:28.159 --> 03:30.599
that you were capable of reviving
over and over.

03:30.680 --> 03:31.919
We wanted to understand your technique.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.960
Secret arts are only used
in the heat of battle.

03:38.039 --> 03:40.639
That's why I was tasked
with observing you from up close

03:40.960 --> 03:43.360
and unraveling the workings
of your technique.

03:45.599 --> 03:48.680
And so I approached you
as the FBI agent, Emma.

03:49.360 --> 03:51.000
Does Mike know about this?

03:51.080 --> 03:52.719
He doesn't.
He's just a civilian.

03:53.479 --> 03:56.000
And that explains the meaning of my life

03:57.520 --> 04:00.080
as a ninja of the organization.

04:01.639 --> 04:03.520
But there is another side to me.

04:05.159 --> 04:07.840
Now we can finally talk, Higan.

04:09.719 --> 04:13.439
<i>That's right, I was the mysterious
benefactor who helped you.</i>

04:14.120 --> 04:16.800
I did it so you could have you revenge.

04:17.600 --> 04:20.000
You observed me
under orders of the organization

04:20.079 --> 04:22.120
while betraying them to help me.

04:22.759 --> 04:23.839
Why?

04:23.920 --> 04:26.480
I have my own personal goal
that I want to achieve,

04:26.560 --> 04:28.879
and there is no way
I can fulfill it

04:29.519 --> 04:31.000
if you happen to die,
so I need you to live.

04:31.079 --> 04:33.120
If you fight those lieutenants again,

04:33.199 --> 04:34.759
you will surely be killed.

04:35.600 --> 04:38.240
The suits that they're equipped
with are simply too powerful.

04:39.199 --> 04:41.199
Your secret art won't help you.

04:41.920 --> 04:43.639
I'm certain there is
no technique in your repertoire

04:44.199 --> 04:47.000
that could save you from that fate.

04:49.000 --> 04:51.319
However, there's still hope.

04:53.319 --> 04:55.439
The power to kill them...

04:57.759 --> 04:58.959
...is right here.

05:02.360 --> 05:04.399
A suit? Interesting.

05:05.199 --> 05:06.519
Yes, it was one still in development

05:06.600 --> 05:08.439
that was brought here
to go through endurance testing.

05:09.839 --> 05:14.000
I believe she prepared to take it in
advance, knowing she would betray us.

05:15.480 --> 05:17.000
This changes nothing.

05:17.399 --> 05:21.040
<i>West D block, clear.
South C block, clear.</i>

05:21.920 --> 05:23.560
Nothing at all.

05:35.319 --> 05:36.839
The Gusoku gear,

05:38.040 --> 05:39.199
an ultra high-grade combat suit

05:39.279 --> 05:41.759
designed to work in harmony
with all sorts of ninja techniques.

05:42.839 --> 05:45.360
It was created by taking
the ninja's 600-year history

05:45.920 --> 05:48.920
and combining it with our cutting
edge technology.

05:50.079 --> 05:51.519
Truly the devil's work.

05:53.079 --> 05:56.639
I was also a part of the development team.

05:59.199 --> 06:01.279
This one here is the most
advanced suit there is.

06:01.800 --> 06:05.480
I just need to finish it, and it
will become like a new body for you.

06:07.360 --> 06:10.720
What happens if the organization
finds us first?

06:31.680 --> 06:33.519
North A block, clear.

06:55.879 --> 06:57.079
Damn it, Mike!

06:58.120 --> 07:00.800
Come on, dude,
you were supposed to be protecting me.

07:00.879 --> 07:03.800
You're a liar,
just like the rest of those bastards.

07:05.959 --> 07:07.600
Worst wake-up call ever.

07:08.160 --> 07:10.920
You've been asleep
for 10 whole days, man.

07:11.639 --> 07:12.639
10 days?

07:12.720 --> 07:15.680
And all that time,
I've been waiting here all by myself.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.600
Did you patch me up?

07:19.319 --> 07:22.360
Well, a doctor friend of mine did.
He doesn't ask any questions,

07:23.759 --> 07:26.480
and I made sure
that we paid him handsomely.

07:27.959 --> 07:29.759
What do you mean by we?

07:30.360 --> 07:31.720
Pretty swanky, huh?

07:31.800 --> 07:33.600
This fella here
belongs to some rich shitheads.

07:34.360 --> 07:37.360
They never use it this time of year,
so don't worry, we're safe.

07:37.839 --> 07:39.839
That's pretty crafty of me,
don't you think?

07:43.000 --> 07:45.879
Anyway,
don't try and give me the FBI act now.

07:46.399 --> 07:47.959
I mean, they're after you too, right?

07:48.800 --> 07:51.759
I'm pretty sure they were tailing me
way before I even left town.

07:52.399 --> 07:54.439
I was careful about things.

07:54.519 --> 07:56.120
I didn't think they'd find me
when they did.

07:57.399 --> 07:58.600
The good news is,

07:59.120 --> 08:02.680
we must be getting real close
to finding their dirty little secrets.

08:03.199 --> 08:04.639
This proves it.

08:25.839 --> 08:27.800
Still doesn't have enough output.

08:31.720 --> 08:34.919
We need the power reactor that serves
at the heart of this suit.

08:35.000 --> 08:38.519
Parts like that are only available
at headquarters.

08:40.080 --> 08:43.440
Forget it. It would be like
walking into our own graves.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.840
Which means we only have one option.

09:07.039 --> 09:10.399
As cold as fire.
Isn't that backwards?

09:11.080 --> 09:13.759
People lose their composure
when they get angry.

09:14.320 --> 09:18.000
On the other hand, people lose their
intensity by being too cautious.

09:18.840 --> 09:22.480
At the end of the day,
feelings aren't something we can control.

09:23.159 --> 09:25.720
But just imagine
if your willpower could counter

09:26.039 --> 09:29.120
that problem by being both fire and ice
at the same time.

09:29.879 --> 09:32.120
If you could do that,
it would make you invincible.

09:32.759 --> 09:34.879
And that's my own ninja philosophy...

09:35.399 --> 09:38.759
be as cold as fire and as hot as ice,

09:39.279 --> 09:41.399
all by forging your mind.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.879
This is the only area remaining.

09:56.759 --> 09:58.440
<i>It has come to our attention
that this water disposal plant</i>

09:58.519 --> 10:00.799
<i>has seen a huge increase
in power consumption</i>

10:00.879 --> 10:02.240
over the last two weeks.

10:02.919 --> 10:03.919
Based on that,

10:04.000 --> 10:07.919
<i>we suspect that they are operating
some sort of large equipment inside.</i>

10:08.600 --> 10:10.000
I'll go check it out.

10:12.200 --> 10:15.679
I've got a good feeling.
My fate is looking extra fly today.

10:22.559 --> 10:25.240
Now that takes care of the reactor
in the armor plating.

10:26.200 --> 10:27.399
Just a little more...

10:34.720 --> 10:37.399
The name of this updated Gusoku gear
is Kamui.

10:38.039 --> 10:40.080
It's a prototype model built from scratch,

10:40.159 --> 10:44.159
an entirely new design meant to achieve
the highest level of combat potential.

10:45.039 --> 10:47.159
Thus, it works differently
from the other suits.

10:47.240 --> 10:49.799
Simply wearing it won't be enough
to tap into its power.

10:51.240 --> 10:54.480
This suit has to be linked
to the user's brain first.

10:54.559 --> 10:56.799
It then operates according
to the mental image

10:56.879 --> 10:59.600
they see in their mind
at the same instant they think of it.

10:59.679 --> 11:03.120
That gives it a reaction time leagues
above the other suits.

11:03.879 --> 11:06.600
The more intensely
that you visualize your own actions,

11:06.679 --> 11:09.200
the faster and stronger
the suit will execute them.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.559
In other words,

11:11.639 --> 11:14.000
this suit responds directly
to the will and actions of its user.

11:14.399 --> 11:15.799
That about sums it up.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.559
However, for this to work,

11:17.919 --> 11:20.639
it requires you to go through a process

11:21.279 --> 11:22.639
to sync it with your brain.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.600
You will be put into a deep sleep,

11:25.159 --> 11:27.320
and you'll be unable to wake up,
no matter what,

11:28.200 --> 11:30.200
even if you got stabbed in the heart.

11:31.159 --> 11:32.960
Let me make one thing perfectly clear.

11:33.399 --> 11:36.320
The next time you die,
it will be your last.

11:38.360 --> 11:41.039
I should know,
since the one who saved you last time...

11:42.440 --> 11:43.639
...was me.

11:45.039 --> 11:48.039
That night,
I used my own secret art.

11:48.840 --> 11:52.679
I completely froze all your cells
by piercing a special pathway,

11:52.759 --> 11:55.440
putting your body
into suspended animation.

11:55.519 --> 11:58.519
After it's been used on someone once,

11:58.600 --> 12:02.120
those pathways close,
and it can never be used again.

12:03.000 --> 12:04.360
It was you.

12:05.480 --> 12:08.200
But why?
Why did you save me?

12:08.559 --> 12:10.720
Why didn't you save my wife
and son instead?

12:11.080 --> 12:15.279
I wouldn't have cared about dying
if only you would have let them live.

12:19.600 --> 12:21.200
Damn you...

13:01.320 --> 13:02.559
Clever girl.

13:09.159 --> 13:10.759
Looks like they fell for the dummy.

13:11.399 --> 13:12.600
Now's my chance.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.720
Hey there, my dear.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.679
The big, bad wolf is here to eat you.

13:19.039 --> 13:20.120
How'd you find us?

13:20.600 --> 13:24.480
Wasn't easy. Did you think I just pulled
the answer out of a fortune cookie?

13:25.080 --> 13:27.720
I sniffed my way all over town
looking for you with no luck,

13:27.799 --> 13:31.679
and I knew there was no way you died,

13:32.440 --> 13:34.559
which can only mean
you were constantly on the move.

13:35.080 --> 13:37.960
Whether it's a limo dropping off a hooker

13:38.279 --> 13:41.600
or some hot DILF pushing a stroller,

13:41.679 --> 13:44.519
every movement in this city is tracked
on the main traffic control server.

13:44.879 --> 13:48.519
Ever since the two of you went missing,

13:48.600 --> 13:51.399
there's been only one vehicle
that's been moving the entire time...

13:51.759 --> 13:55.360
and it was none other than
this truck!

13:56.080 --> 13:58.960
My God, that was a really smart move.

13:59.039 --> 14:01.000
Nobody would ever question
an advertising truck

14:01.080 --> 14:02.840
roaming around town like some lost dog.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.600
Synchro rate is only at 10%.

14:06.159 --> 14:09.399
And that ninja boy doesn't belong to you.

14:10.320 --> 14:13.360
He's my piece of ass.
And this time, I'm going to climax, baby.

14:36.519 --> 14:40.320
I've dreamed about this, engaging
in a fight with one of the other suits,

14:40.399 --> 14:41.919
just to see what it was like.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.639
I'm gonna split you in two!

14:55.240 --> 14:57.600
Our next move
is to find all the people on that list.

14:58.159 --> 14:59.960
How do you expect me
to track them down?

15:00.480 --> 15:03.039
I can't go home anymore because of you,

15:03.120 --> 15:06.039
which means there's no way for me
to hack into their database.

15:06.120 --> 15:07.279
Need a computer.

15:07.840 --> 15:10.200
Damn it.
That's not my area of expertise.

15:10.960 --> 15:13.440
She would know better
about that than I would.

15:14.480 --> 15:16.279
Wait a minute.

15:16.879 --> 15:19.200
I know where there's one.

15:38.759 --> 15:42.919
You better not start screaming too soon.
I prefer more foreplay than this.

15:51.879 --> 15:55.320
Trash like you can never be a ninja.

15:56.440 --> 15:59.559
You're just a pathetic, dirty, little man
looking for some cheap thrills.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.600
And to prove my point,

16:13.679 --> 16:15.759
you came here without telling
any of the others, didn't you?

16:15.840 --> 16:18.200
Yeah, that's right, baby.

16:20.080 --> 16:23.399
I don't give a rat's ass
about what the organization thinks.

16:28.399 --> 16:31.039
Listen up, lady.
I just want to fight.

16:31.440 --> 16:33.720
None of those other little pricks
can get me off,

16:33.799 --> 16:35.480
so it's got to be a battle to the death

16:35.559 --> 16:37.919
where we use every one of our muscles.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.720
That's why I became a ninja!

16:45.840 --> 16:51.519
You don't even come close to what a true
ninja is capable of, you tiny freak!

16:52.399 --> 16:55.399
Yeah. I'm really starting
to feel it in my pants now.

16:56.000 --> 16:59.159
You're pretty good for a stupid bitch!

17:10.559 --> 17:12.799
So you took control of my optics?

18:21.279 --> 18:27.960
You can't seriously think that you
had what it takes to get the better of me!

18:33.279 --> 18:35.000
Not yet.
Just a little more.

18:36.440 --> 18:38.759
Can you hear my voice?

18:43.519 --> 18:45.720
I'm playing a recording I made

18:46.720 --> 18:51.119
directly into your subconscious.

18:52.319 --> 18:56.799
<i>If you're listening to this, then
it's possible that I'm already dead.</i>

18:58.400 --> 19:00.240
You asked me why I saved you.

19:00.920 --> 19:06.440
<i>The truth is that long ago, your wife,
Mari, once saved my life.</i>

19:07.720 --> 19:10.720
<i>And ever since then, Mari and I
have secretly stayed in touch.</i>

19:11.400 --> 19:12.920
<i>Even on
the night of her death,</i>

19:13.319 --> 19:15.079
when I heard about the attack,

19:15.759 --> 19:17.799
<i>I rushed to your house
to try to save you all.</i>

19:18.400 --> 19:19.839
But by the time I arrived,

19:19.920 --> 19:23.119
it was too late to save Mari or Ren.

19:24.599 --> 19:28.319
<i>The only one I had the chance to save
was you.</i>

19:29.799 --> 19:32.920
<i>I'm sorry that
I couldn't save your wife,</i>

19:33.680 --> 19:35.920
<i>and I'm sorry
that I couldn't save your son.</i>

19:36.480 --> 19:40.920
<i>It's all the more reason I want
to make her wish for you to come true.</i>

19:42.160 --> 19:44.000
Mari used to tell me her dream for you

19:45.440 --> 19:47.160
was to live on.

19:48.799 --> 19:51.000
I've done everything I can now.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.640
Sayonara.

20:25.680 --> 20:27.880
That's my own ninja philosophy,

20:29.359 --> 20:32.839
be as cold as fire and as hot as ice,

20:34.720 --> 20:36.519
by forging your mind.

20:43.000 --> 20:47.920
Subtitling
FAST TITLES MEDIA
